# Single "trajectory" setpoint for simplified avoidance: hold a target point
# while optionally mixing in a feed-forward velocity/acceleration vector.
# Position, velocity, and acceleration are expressed in frame_id.
# Each xyz / vxyz / axyz group must be either ALL finite or ALL NaN
# (NaN in every field of a group disables that group). At least one group
# must be set.
float32 x
float32 y
float32 z
float32 vx
float32 vy
float32 vz
float32 ax
float32 ay
float32 az
float32 yaw
float32 yaw_rate
string frame_id
bool auto_arm
---
bool success
string message
